      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. Let me write an improved version with clearer variable names, simplified feature array setup, and clarifying comments.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version replaces cryptic auto-generated variable names with descriptive ones (`feature`, `allSameFeature`, `features`, `original`, `withFeatureEnabled`), simplifies the repetitive array initialization with a loop, and adds comments explaining the non-obvious behaviors (why `get()` returns `false` despite the feature being in the enabled array, and why `hasLenient()` returns `true` for a `Boolean.FALSE` lenient value)."
    }
